---
title: Staff - Change Role Flow (PATCH /staff/:id/role)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Manager Client
    participant Ctrl as StaffController
    participant Guard as AuthGuard
    participant RGuard as RolesGuard
    participant Service as StaffService
    participant StaffModel as StaffInfoModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant AccountModel as AccountModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant DB as Database (SQL Server)

    note right of Client: PATCH /staff/:id/role (with Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: ChangeRoleDto (roleName) + path :id (staffId)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Guard: canActivate(context)
    Guard->>Guard: Verify JWT
    Guard-->>Ctrl: Attach user to request & return true
    Ctrl->>RGuard: canActivate(context)
    RGuard->>RGuard: Resolve metadata @Roles('Manager')
    RGuard-->>Ctrl: return true

    Ctrl->>Service: changeRole(id, dto.roleName)
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: isValidRole(roleName)
    opt Role not allowed
        Service-->>Client: Throw NotFoundException (Role not found)
    end

    Service->>StaffModel: findOne({ where: { staffId: id } })
    StaffModel->>DB: SELECT * FROM StaffInfo WHERE StaffId = ?
    DB-->>StaffModel: row / null
    StaffModel-->>Service: StaffInfo Entity / null
    opt Staff not found
        Service-->>Client: Throw NotFoundException
    end

    Note over Service, DB: Run inside Transaction (dataSource.transaction)

    Service->>AccountModel: update({ accountId: staff.accountId }, { role: roleName })
    AccountModel->>DB: UPDATE Accounts SET Role = ? WHERE AccountId = ?
    DB-->>AccountModel: ok

    Service-->>Ctrl: void (success)
    deactivate Service
    Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 200 - { message: "Role updated successfully" }
    deactivate Ctrl
